WEBVTT

00:00.160 --> 00:01.160
As for the rest

00:01.240 --> 00:02.600
I won't ask more

00:02.680 --> 00:04.040
About this matter

00:04.120 --> 00:06.160
I only have one last question

00:06.920 --> 00:08.240
Father, please ask

00:08.320 --> 00:09.987
Deploying the city defense troops

00:10.200 --> 00:11.640
Was it your order

00:11.920 --> 00:14.160
Or Chu Huan acting on his own?

00:14.640 --> 00:16.040
Answer truthfully
